@startuml POS - Sales Representative Use Case

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Sales Representative" as SalesRep
actor "Customer" as Customer

rectangle "POS System - Sales Module" {
    usecase "Browse Product Catalog" as UC_Catalog
    usecase "Check Stock Availability" as UC_Stock
    usecase "Identify/Register Customer" as UC_Customer
    usecase "Create Pre-Order" as UC_CreateOrder
    usecase "Add Items to Cart" as UC_AddItems
    usecase "Apply Discount" as UC_Discount
    usecase "Save Order (Pending Payment)" as UC_SaveOrder
    usecase "Generate Order Ticket" as UC_Ticket
}

' Relacionamentos do Vendedor
SalesRep --> UC_Catalog
SalesRep --> UC_Customer
SalesRep --> UC_CreateOrder

' Inclusões e Extensões
UC_Catalog <.. UC_Stock : <<include>>
UC_CreateOrder ..> UC_AddItems : <<include>>
UC_CreateOrder ..> UC_SaveOrder : <<include>>
UC_SaveOrder ..> UC_Ticket : <<include>>

UC_AddItems <.. UC_Discount : <<extend>>

' Interação do Cliente (Opcional no caso de uso, mas mostra o fluxo do negócio)
Customer --> UC_Customer : Provides Details
Customer --> UC_Ticket : Receives Ticket

@endum
